{"abstract":"In accordance with the Federal Advisory Committee Act, as amended, the National Aeronautics and Space Administration (NASA) announces a meeting of the Aeronautics Committee of the NASA Advisory Council (NAC). This meeting will be held for soliciting, from the aeronautics community and other persons, research, and technical information relevant to program planning.","action":"Notice of meeting.","agencies":[{"id":301,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/301","name":"National Aeronautics and Space Administration","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"NATIONAL AERONAUTICS AND SPACE ADMINISTRATION","slug":"national-aeronautics-and-space-administration","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/national-aeronautics-and-space-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06921.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19138","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Wednesday, April 27, 2022, 11:30 a.m.-5:30 p.m., Eastern Time.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Notice (22-023)"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06921","effective_on":null,"end_page":19139,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06921.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06921/nasa-advisory-council-aeronautics-committee-meeting","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06921?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06921/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"page_length":2,"page_views":{"count":99,"last_updated":"2026-10-23 08:15:04 -0400"},"pdf_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-04-01/pdf/2022-06921.pdf","presidential_document_number":null,"proclamation_number":null